"j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"30:24","t":"And of His signs is [that] He shows you the lightning [causing] fear and aspiration, and He sends down rain from the sky by which He brings to life the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed in that are signs for a people who use reason.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":24,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":41,"surahs":[30],"sajdah":false}